            </note>
            <note corresp="#d263-f3" n="3" xml:id="d263-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to NSDM 158, <ref target="#d243"
                        >Document 243</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d263-f4" n="4" xml:id="d263-f4-content">
                <p>In telegram USDEL SALT 1261 from Helsinki, April
                    14, the delegation submitted its recommendations on SLBMs, ABM limitations, and
                    provisions for the duration of and withdrawal from the proposed agreement on
                    freezing offensive weapons. (National Archives, RG 59, Central Files 1970–73, DEF 18–3 FIN (HE))</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
